### Add a service area to a vehicle
### Areas belong to the vehicle, not the partner. A vehicle with no area never appears in a search.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel-partners/4aa12692-6972-4772-8c54-19d5933f76bc/vehicles/d403ccd6-4cc9-4cd8-8ca2-170e37c4632a/service-areas
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bhubaneswar",
  "latitude": 20.2961,
  "longitude": 85.8245,
  "radiusKm": 50
}
